{
    "title": "Color Ball Sort Wooden Puzzle",
    "description": "Color Ball Sort Wooden Puzzle is a free time killer game. Gameplay is very simple: just tap the tube to sort all the same color balls into the tubes. The winning condition of the game is that the balls of the same color are placed in the same tube. A challenging yet relaxing game to exercise your brain!\r\n\r\nWith simple gameplay combined with many relaxing sounds with a theme close to nature, Color Ball Sort Wooden Puzzle promises to bring you a feeling of relaxation, comfort and help train your brain.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY:\r\n\u2b50 Tap the tube to move balls into other tubes.\r\n\u2b50 The rule is that you can only move a ball on top of another ball if both of them have the same color and the tube you want to move into has enough space.\r\n\u2b50 Try not to get stuck - you can always use hints or restart the level at any time\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\u2b50 Simple graphics and classic style.\r\n\u2b50 Variety of tubes with interesting shapes.\r\n\u2b50 Easy to control with one finger.\r\n\u2b50 More than 1000 levels to experience.\r\n\u2b50 Relaxing sounds good for relieving your mood.\r\n\u2b50 TOTAL FREE & EASY TO PLAY.\r\n\r\nPlay Color Ball Sort Wooden Puzzle now to get rid of daily fatigue and bring moments of relaxation!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Color Ball Sort Wooden Puzzle is a free time killer game. Gameplay is very simple: just tap the tube to sort all the same color balls into the tubes. The winning condition of the game is that the balls of the same color are placed in the same tube. A challenging yet relaxing game to exercise your brain!<br><br>With simple gameplay combined with many relaxing sounds with a theme close to nature, Color Ball Sort Wooden Puzzle promises to bring you a feeling of relaxation, comfort and help train your brain.<br><br>HOW TO PLAY:<br>\u2b50 Tap the tube to move balls into other tubes.<br>\u2b50 The rule is that you can only move a ball on top of another ball if both of them have the same color and the tube you want to move into has enough space.<br>\u2b50 Try not to get stuck - you can always use hints or restart the level at any time<br><br>FEATURES:<br>\u2b50 Simple graphics and classic style.<br>\u2b50 Variety of tubes with interesting shapes.<br>\u2b50 Easy to control with one finger.<br>\u2b50 More than 1000 levels to experience.<br>\u2b50 Relaxing sounds good for relieving your mood.<br>\u2b50 TOTAL FREE &amp; EASY TO PLAY.<br><br>Play Color Ball Sort Wooden Puzzle now to get rid of daily fatigue and bring moments of relaxation!",
